OL,3,GNEWSABalloon pilot breaks record year
OL,4,Aon from surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hot air balloon pilot who survived a
OL,7,Flife-threatening twisted bowel has set
OL,8,Fa Guinness World Record at the Bristol
OL,9,FInternational Balloon Fiesta.
OL,11,FJo Bailey, 65, completed 68 tethered
OL,12,Fhopper balloon ascents at Ashton Court
OL,13,FEstate on 7 August, breaking the
OL,14,Fprevious record of 30.
OL,16,FBailey completed the challenge a year
OL,17,Fafter undergoing several surgeries that
OL,18,Fleft her with a permanent ileostomy - a
OL,19,Ftype of stoma.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
