OL,3,GNEWSABalloon pilot breaks record year
OL,4,Aon from surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said the attempt was "never really
OL,7,Fabout the record" but was about showing
OL,8,Fpeople that "life doesn't end after
OL,9,Fmajor surgery".
